" **Pacific Engine Parts Ltd - Procurement Terms**\n\n1. **Lead Time**\n   - In-stock items: Delivery within 3 business days from receipt of order and payment.\n   - Overseas items: Delivery within 15-20 business days from receipt of order and payment.\n\n2. **Minimum Order Quantity (MOQ)**\n   - Standard parts: MOQ of 1 unit per part number, except for specialty parts as specified separately.\n   - Bulk orders: Special arrangements can be made for orders exceeding 50 units, with a minimum MOQ of 25 units per part number.\n\n3. **Price Validity**\n   - Prices quoted are valid for 60 days from the date of the quote unless otherwise specified.\n\n4. **Payment Terms**\n   - Net 30 Days: Payment is due within 30 days of the invoice date. Failure to pay within this period may result in late payment fees as outlined below.\n\n5. **Late Payment Interest**\n   - In case of late payment, a monthly interest rate of 1.5% will be charged on the outstanding amount.\n\n6. **Warranty**\n   - All parts come with a standard warranty of 12 months from the date of delivery. Extended warranties may be available upon request and at an additional cost.\n\n7. **Bulk Discounts**\n   - Orders exceeding 50 units will receive a 10% discount on the total invoice amount.\n   - Orders exceeding 100 units will receive a 20% discount on the total invoice amount.\n\n8. **Shipping**\n   - Pacific Engine Parts Ltd does not handle shipping directly. Shipping arrangements should be made through port-side agents. We will provide all necessary documentation for shipping.\n\n9. **Certification Documents**\n   - All parts supplied by Pacific Engine Parts Ltd are backed by the relevant class society approval documents, including ABS, BV, DNV GL, and LR. These documents will be provided upon request.\n\n10. **Emergency Parts Hotline**\n    - In case of emergency, our hotline is available 24/7 at +1-555-1234. Please note that additional charges may apply for emergency shipments.\n\nBy placing an order with Pacific Engine Parts Ltd, you agree to these terms and conditions. If you have any questions or concerns, please do not hesitate to contact us."